{
  "Name": "IBM Lotus Notes Client URL Handler Command Injection",
  "Description": "This module exploits a command injection vulnerability in the URL handler for for the IBM Lotus Notes Client <= 8.5.3. The registered handler can be abused with a specially crafted notes:// URL to execute arbitrary commands with also arbitrary arguments. This module has been tested successfully on Windows XP SP3 with IE8, Google Chrome 23.0.1271.97 m and IBM Lotus Notes Client 8.5.2.",
